      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "For travelers, Nói chậm chút được không? is the phrase to keep ready for \"Can you speak a little slower\" in moments when Vietnamese stops making sense. This is for when you need the other person to slow down. It works best when you focus on asking for one clear help action before adding more words. The forms below help you choose the version that fits the person, setting, or level of politeness.",
